      "extendedData": [
        {
          "name": "OracleText",
          "displayName": "Rules Text Contains",
          "value": "The Kamigawa: Neon Dynasty White Theme Booster contains 35 cards, with a combination of 1–2 cards of rarity Rare or higher and 33–34 Uncommon and/or Common cards.\r\n<br>Theme Boosters let you pick the kind of cards you want to upgrade your favorite decks. Every card in a Theme Booster can go in a deck of that color or style, so you can be confident you're getting what you want.\r\n<br><br>Key Product Features:\r\n<br>• 35 Kamigawa: Neon Dynasty Cards\r\n<br>• Open a booster full of white MTG cards—the color of armies and defense\r\n<br>• 1–2 cards of rarity Rare or higher in every booster\r\n<br>• The best Magic: The Gathering boosters for deck building\r\n<br>• Just add 25 lands to build a 60-card deck\r\n<br>• With cyberpunk cards full of color and chrome—the future is bright in Kamigawa"
        }
